{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2021-chemistry-13","exam":"MDEET","year":2021,"subject":"chemistry","number":13,"points":4,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"엔트로피·열화학·자유에너지","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","organic_rxn","gas"],"stem":"표는 298K에서 벤젠(C6H6), \n산소(O2), \n이산화탄소(CO2), \n물\n(H2O)의 열화학 자료를 나타낸 것이다.\n표준 생성 자유 에너지\n표준 몰 엔트로피\no(kJ/mol)\nSo(J/K·mol)\nΔGf\nC6H6(l)\n120\n170\nO2(g)\n0\n200\nCO2(g)\n−400\n210\nH2O(l)\n−240\n70\n298K에서 1몰의 액체 벤젠이 완전 연소하는 반응에 대한 설명으로 \n옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? (단, 액체의 부피는 \n무시하고, 기체 상수 R는 8.31J/mol·K이다.)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 표준 반응 자유 에너지(ΔGo)는 −3240kJ이다.\nㄴ. 표준 반응 엔트로피(ΔSo)는 −200J/K이다.\nㄷ. 표준 반응 내부 에너지(ΔEo)는 표준 반응 엔탈피(ΔHo)\n보다 (1.5×8.31×298)J만큼 크다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t031"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":605,"height":33,"region":0,"bbox":[56.7,5.856,242.0,13.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-13/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":12,"height":17,"region":0,"bbox":[27.9,33.856,4.8,6.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-13/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":771,"height":330,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,59.856,308.4,132.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","